Package: pipewire-bluez5-codec-aac
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libspa-0.2-bluetooth (= 1.6.9-2), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: PipeWire Bluetooth AAC codec (A2DP)
 AAC codec plugin for PipeWire 1.6.9, built separately because Debian's
 PipeWire package does not include the non-free FDK AAC dependency.
 Rebuild this plugin when upgrading the matching PipeWire package.
